OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 FEB
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,9,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,10,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,11,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,12,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,13,G1300FClassical Live
OL,14,     GThe Trio Orelon play Beethoven's
OL,15,     Gmonumental Archduke Trio, the
OL,16,     GRotterdam Philharmonic play
OL,17,     GMozart Symphony No.39, plus more
OL,18,     Gfestive music for Brass Band.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
