OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,5,     GRachmaninov builds a new home in
OL,6,     GSwitzerland, a villa called
OL,7,     GSenar, which attempts to recreate
OL,8,     Gaspects of the Russian home he'd
OL,9,     Ghad to leave behind.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,12,     Gmusic in the studio from pianist
OL,13,     GBoris Giltburg ahead of Cambridge
OL,14,     GMusic Festival, and talks to
OL,15,     Gconductor Tess Jackson about
OL,16,     GChromatica Orchestra.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,20,     Gincluding Beethoven, Haydn,
OL,21,     GWilliam Grant Still and Yann
OL,22,     GTiersen.
